[{"id":3645284720,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7ZRqFw","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/946600?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copilot-pull-request-reviewer","id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer[bot]","type":"Bot","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-pull-request-reviewer%5Bbot%5D"},"body":"## Pull request overview\n\nThis PR fixes a bug where the OptionButton's PopupMenu fails to shrink when switching from larger to smaller items. The root cause is that the PopupMenu's minimum size persists from previous content, preventing the window from shrinking.\n\n**Key changes:**\n- Resets PopupMenu's minimum size to (0, 0) before opening to allow proper shrinking\n- Explicitly enables height shrinking to ensure the popup recalculates its size based on current content\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/godotengine/godot/new/master/.github/instructions?filename=*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114806#pullrequestreview-3645284720","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114806","author_association":"NONE","submitted_at":"2026-01-09T19:21:40Z"},{"id":3646605492,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7ZWsi0","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"72ed25ea240801a946123384d1bb21a375bc593d","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"